    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00001",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[1]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "模拟测试招标文件：青禾园区事件闭环平台",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00002",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[2]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "本文件完全为功能测试编制，不对应真实采购或真实企业。项目编号：SIM-WB-20261011。单一标包，内容为软件集成及一年运维服务，不含硬件供货和土建。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00003",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[3]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "一、基本信息",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00004",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[4]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "采购预算：100万元（模拟）。实施期：合同签订后60个日历日。质保及运维：验收后12个月。所有金额和日期仅用于测试。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00005",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[5]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "二、采购需求",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00006",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[6]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "R1：接入既有告警平台，支持HTTPS JSON接口、告警去重与来源追溯。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00007",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[7]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "R2：提供事件登记、工单派发、接单、处置、复核、归档六个状态；复核不通过须退回处置并保留日志。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00008",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[8]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "R3：实现管理员、调度员、处置人员三类角色和最小权限控制；操作审计日志保留不少于180天。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00009",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[9]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "R4：提供事件列表、超时预警、闭环率统计和按时间导出功能。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00010",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[10]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "R5：验收至少包含接口联调、状态流转、权限隔离、异常恢复四类测试，提供用例与结果。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00011",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[11]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "R6：工作日服务，故障2小时内响应，24小时内提供处置计划；该时限须在响应文件承诺并有资源依据。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00012",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[12]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "三、评分标准（总分100分）",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00013",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[13]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "S1价格30分：满足条件的最低报价/本供应商报价×30。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00014",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[14]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "S2事件闭环设计25分：状态设计10分；异常及退回机制8分；权限及日志7分，逐项描述并配流程图。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00015",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[15]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "S3集成及验收20分：接口映射10分；四类测试及验收证据10分。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00016",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[16]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "S4服务方案15分：响应机制8分；人员排班和培训7分。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00017",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[17]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "S5类似业绩10分：提供一份软件平台集成合同复印件及验收证明，两者齐备计10分，否则0分。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00018",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[18]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "四、资格与否决",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00019",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[19]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "Q1须提供有效营业执照复印件；缺失则资格审查不通过。Q2投标函须有签署及盖章；缺失则否决。Q3不得提供虚假证明。未满足R3日志180天要求属于实质性不响应，否决。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00020",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[20]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "五、强制格式",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00021",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[21]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "必须包括：1投标函、2报价表、3资格证明、4技术服务方案、5逐项响应表、6业绩附件。4.1事件闭环管理、4.2集成与验收、4.3服务保障。",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00022",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[22]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "六、测试输入状态",
        "method": "native"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SRC-001-B00023",
        "source_id": "SRC-001",
        "location": "body[23]/paragraph",
        "page": null,
        "text": "本次没有提供供应商营业执照、合同、验收证明、人员资料或有效签署，不得把描述文字或生成图片当作这些材料。",
        "method": "native"
      }
    ],
